Read-only audit of /Users/sashaabramovich/live-spec. Do NOT edit. Return ≤700 words: ledger rows in EXACTLY this format, citing SOURCE (file + heading + line):
`capability | canonical owner | anchor | input | output | boundary ("does not do") | invocation/route | proof | state(working/partial/prose-only/stale)`

Domain: authoring skills. One or two rows per capability, reading each SKILL.md body (headings + defining lines):
1. spec-author (skills/spec-author/SKILL.md): start/grow/sync a spec; requirement genre; clean-writer road;
2. test-author (skills/test-author/SKILL.md): matrix derivation; red-first tests;
3. text-audit (skills/text-audit/SKILL.md): cold-reader audit; register lint invocation (:328,:459); by-hand fallback (:418);
4. communicator (skills/communicator/SKILL.md): capture echo; delivery report; departures board; live status line; estimate ledger prose (:205-208); pre-show register lint duty;
5. feedback-intake (skills/feedback-intake/SKILL.md): five-route table (:52-62), refuses to open queue rows (:38-40);
6. feedback-collector (skills/feedback-collector/SKILL.md): enabled-only trigger; outbox deposit (T-21).
Invocation column: which door/route/gate actually invokes each (cite build-pipeline SKILL.md line or frontmatter trigger). Proof: name the real test files/matrix rows or "string-only"/"none". Flag: capabilities described but never mechanically invoked; duplicate authority (same duty stated in two skills); anything stale vs the tree.
